<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>面试稿教练</title>
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=DM+Sans:wght@400;500;600;700&family=Noto+Sans+SC:wght@400;500;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/styles.css">
</head>
<body>
  <div class="page">
    <header class="header">
      <a class="logo" href="/">面试稿<span>·</span>教练</a>
      <p class="tagline">把面试复盘，变成下一次的底气</p>
    </header>

    <section class="hero">
      <div class="hero-content">
        <span class="badge">INTERVIEW REVIEW</span>
        <h1>让每一句回答<br><em>更有说服力</em></h1>
        <p class="hero-desc">粘贴录音转写稿，或上传 PDF。几分钟内梳理表达短板、需要补的证据，以及下一轮该怎么答。</p>
      </div>
      <div class="hero-points">
        <div class="point">优先级明确的改进点</div>
        <div class="point">每一项对应的原文证据</div>
        <div class="point">可直接练习的追问清单</div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="workspace">
      <div class="input-card">
        <div class="card-header">
          <div>
            <span class="step">01</span>
            <h2>放入你的面试稿</h2>
          </div>
          <label class="role-label">
            目标岗位
            <input id="role" type="text" placeholder="例如：产品经理">
          </label>
        </div>

        <div class="tabs">
          <button class="tab active" data-tab="paste">粘贴文字</button>
          <button class="tab" data-tab="pdf">上传 PDF</button>
        </div>

        <div id="paste-pane">
          <textarea id="transcript" placeholder="把面试录音转写稿粘贴在这里…&#10;&#10;建议保留提问和回答的原始顺序，分析会更准确。"></textarea>
        </div>

        <div id="pdf-pane" class="hidden">
          <label class="dropzone" for="pdf-file">
            <input id="pdf-file" type="file" accept="application/pdf,.pdf">
            <div class="upload-icon">↑</div>
            <div class="upload-text">
              <strong>选择一份 PDF 文字稿</strong>
              <span>只读取可复制文本的 PDF，不会保存文件</span>
            </div>
          </label>
          <p id="pdf-status" class="status"></p>
        </div>

        <div class="actions">
          <span class="privacy">内容只在本次分析中处理，不会被保存</span>
          <button id="analyze" class="btn-primary">开始分析 →</button>
        </div>
        <p id="error" class="error"></p>
      </div>

      <aside class="guide-card">
        <span class="step">02</span>
        <h3>好稿的三个信号</h3>
        <ul class="signals">
          <li>
            <strong>先结论</strong>
            <span>让面试官快速抓住重点</span>
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong>有证据</strong>
            <span>案例、数据和你的具体动作</span>
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong>能复盘</strong>
            <span>讲清判断、取舍与下一步</span>
          </li>
        </ul>
        <div class="sample-box">
          <span>不知道怎么开始？</span>
          <button id="load-sample">试试示例文字稿 →</button>
        </div>
      </aside>
    </section>

    <section id="results" class="results hidden" aria-live="polite"></section>
  </div>

  <footer class="footer">
    面试稿教练 · 仅作练习参考，请结合真实经历调整表述
  </footer>

  <script type="module" src="/app.js"></script>
</body>
</html>
